aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, let's use integration by parts:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}u=A(t) & ⇒ & du={A}^{′}(t)\\text{ }dt \\\\ dv={{field-3}} & ⇒ & v=-\\frac{1}{s}{e}^{-st}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSubstituting into the integration by parts formula, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{0}^{\\infty }{e}^{-st}A(t)\\,dt & =A(t)(-\\frac{1}{s}{e}^{-st})\\,{|}_{0}^{\\infty }-{\\int }_{0}^{\\infty }({{field-4}}){A}^{′}(t)\\,dt\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSince $-\\frac{1}{s}A(t){e}^{-st}{|}_{0}^{\\infty }=$ $0$, we have\n\n$$\n{\\int }_{0}^{\\infty }{e}^{-st}A(t)\\,dt=\\frac{1}{s}{\\int }_{0}^{\\infty }{{field-5}}\\,\\,dt.\n$$\n\nFinally, using that ${A}^{′}(t)=f(t),$ we obtain\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{1}{s}{\\int }_{0}^{\\infty }{e}^{-st}{A}^{′}(t)\\,dt & =\\frac{1}{s}{\\int }_{0}^{\\infty }{e}^{-st}f(t)\\,dt \\\\  & ={{field-6}}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139536011 true] [17592186379384 1113 #uuid "8bfadb68-c634-5617-a1c3-ca1ddae49650" 13194139536011 true] [17592186379384 1145 "Let $A(t)$ be the anti-derivative of $f(t)$ such that ${A}^{′}(t)=f(t)$ and $A(0)=0.$ Then,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{0}^{t}f(τ)\\,dτ & =A(τ)\\,{|}_{0}^{t} \\\\  & =A(t)-A(0) \\\\  & =A(t).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nBy definition of the Laplace transform, we can write\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}L{{\\int }_{0}^{t}f(τ)\\,\\text{d}τ} & =L{A(t)}={\\int }_{0}^{\\infty }{e}^{-st}A(t)\\,\\text{d}t.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, let's use integration by parts:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}u=A(t) & \\,⇒\\, & du={A}^{′}(t)\\,dt \\\\ dv={e}^{-st}\\,dt & ⇒ & v=-\\frac{1}{s}{e}^{-st}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSubstituting into the integration by parts formula, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{0}^{\\infty }{e}^{-st}A(t)\\,dt & =A(t)(-\\frac{1}{s}{e}^{-st})\\,{|}_{0}^{\\infty }-{\\int }_{0}^{\\infty }(-\\frac{1}{s}{e}^{-st}){A}^{′}(t)\\,dt.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSince $A(0)=0$ and $\\frac{1}{s}{e}^{-st}\\to 0$ as $t\\to \\infty ,$ we have $-\\frac{1}{s}A(t){e}^{-st}{|}_{0}^{\\infty }=0$ and\n\n$$\n{\\int }_{0}^{\\infty }{e}^{-st}A(t)\\,dt=\\frac{1}{s}{\\int }_{0}^{\\infty }{e}^{-st}{A}^{′}(t)\\,dt.\n$$\n\nFinally, using that ${A}^{′}(t)=f(t),$ we obtain\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{1}{s}{\\int }_{0}^{\\infty }{e}^{-st}{A}^{′}(t)\\,dt & =\\frac{1}{s}{\\int }_{0}^{\\infty }{e}^{-st}f(t)\\,dt \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{s}\\cdot F(s) \\\\  & =\\frac{F(s)}{s}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139536011 true] [17592186379385 1000 #edb/ref 17592186379386 13194139536011 true] [17592186379385 1000 #edb/ref 17592186379387 13194139536011 true] [17592186379385 1000 #edb/ref 17592186379388 13194139536011 true] [17592186379385 1000 #edb/ref 17592186379389 13194139536011 true] [17592186379385 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045451 13194139536011 true] [17592186379385 1041 "field-1" 13194139536011 true] [17592186379385 1104 #edb/ref 17592186379388 13194139536011 true] [17592186379385 1110 #uuid "aa6e736b-056d-535c-92e9-6b882ecf50ce" 13194139536011 true] [17592186379386 1034 "f(τ)" 13194139536011 true] [17592186379386 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139536011 true] [17592186379386 1111 #uuid "04f4c794-b54e-52a1-a7bd-8387dc9f3dc8" 13194139536011 true] [17592186379387 1034 "{f}^{′}(τ)" 13194139536011 true] [17592186379387 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139536011 true] [17592186379387 1111 #uuid "1174f08a-d27d-5f1e-bf18-6124fe73cf05" 13194139536011 true] [17592186379388 1034 "A(τ)" 13194139536011 true] [17592186379388 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139536011 true] [17592186379388 1111 #uuid "82821487-e7bc-5d5f-bc8f-5c414475b01f" 13194139536011 true] [17592186379389 1034 "{A}^{′}(τ)" 13194139536011 true] [17592186379389 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139536011 true] [17592186379389 1111 #uuid "8f3c7730-e4a2-5af3-8513-9c1338a8bb6c" 13194139536011 true] [17592186379390 1000 #edb/ref 17592186379391 13194139536011 true] [17592186379390 1000 #edb/ref 17592186379392 13194139536011 true] [17592186379390 1000 #edb/ref 17592186379393 13194139536011 true] [17592186379390 1000 #edb/ref 17592186379394 13194139536011 true] [17592186379390 1040 